To install it like an app:
iPhone or iPad: open the address in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.
Android: open it in Chrome, tap the menu, then Install app or Add to Home screen.
Computer: in Chrome or Edge, use the install icon in the address bar.
After the first visit it opens with no signal.

What coaches should know:
Each coach's team, lineups and scores are saved on their own device, in that browser.
Nothing is sent anywhere.
Clearing the browser's site data erases the team. Team setup > Save a backup file
makes a file they can load on another device.
Changing positions, players or rotation settings rebuilds the lineups and clears any
spots changed by hand on the Game tab.
